      "id": "msg_0147_D51R0301_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: The snowbound ruins make\n",
        "me wonder...\r",
        "Time and space change, and we with\n",
        "them. We leave some things behind\f",
        "and give each other company...\r",
        "Sinnoh, Johto...\n",
        "When you feel you’re close to\f",
        "understanding the whole world,\f",
        "you are merely drowning in your\f",
        "own miniscule perception.\r"
      ]
